WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:06.500
Each child has their own settings. Open Settings and pick the child at the top.

00:07.101 --> 00:13.719
The daily goal sets how many minutes of learning fill their progress bar on the home screen.

00:14.319 --> 00:20.770
Subjects lets you choose what shows up in lessons, Adventure and the Daily Challenge.

00:20.770 --> 00:23.653
French is optional and off by default.

00:24.253 --> 00:30.705
Arcade games are earned with learning time. You can change the ratio, allow free play,

00:30.705 --> 00:32.055
or turn games off.

00:32.655 --> 00:37.253
Changes save automatically and sync to your other devices.
